1            (base 10) sums to 1; read as text, 1
1234         (base 10) sums to 10; read as text, 10
fe           (base 16) sums to 29; read as text, 29
f0e          (base 16) sums to 29; read as text, 29

12345        (base 10) sums to 15; read as text, 15
11111111     (base 2) sums to 8; read as text, 8
zz           (base 36) sums to 70; read as text, 70
2^1000 has digits summing to 1366
100! has digits summing to 648
-123045 sums to 15
f0e read in base 16 sums to 29
19 read in base 8: '9' is no digit in base 8
